WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.786
Hi! How do we say a big red ball? Today we'll learn describing words: colours, sizes and opposites.

2
00:00:09.936 --> 00:00:14.946
Colours are describing words: red, blue, green, yellow.

3
00:00:15.096 --> 00:00:19.746
Size words describe too: big, small, long, short.

4
00:00:19.896 --> 00:00:24.066
A describing word goes before the noun: a red ball.

5
00:00:24.216 --> 00:00:28.986
It can also come after is: The ball is red.

6
00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:33.522
Words with opposite meanings are opposites: big and small.

7
00:00:33.672 --> 00:00:35.994
Hot and cold.

8
00:00:36.144 --> 00:00:39.090
Happy and sad, fast and slow.

9
00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:44.106
Short is the opposite of tall and also of long.

10
00:00:44.256 --> 00:00:47.706
Watch out! We don't say a ball red!

11
00:00:47.856 --> 00:00:51.234
The describing word goes before the noun.

12
00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:55.098
So say: a red ball.

13
00:00:55.248 --> 00:01:03.114
Your turn! What is the opposite of hot? Pause and think.

14
00:01:03.264 --> 00:01:08.538
The opposite of hot is cold. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:08.688 --> 00:01:17.034
Another one! Is an elephant big or small? Pause and think.

16
00:01:17.184 --> 00:01:22.122
An elephant is big. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:22.272 --> 00:01:30.402
Here's another! What is the opposite of happy? Pause and think.

18
00:01:30.552 --> 00:01:35.898
The opposite of happy is sad. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:36.048 --> 00:01:43.914
Try one more! The grass is, ___. Pause and think.

20
00:01:44.064 --> 00:01:48.738
Grass is green. Did you get it right?

21
00:01:48.888 --> 00:01:56.394
Try one more! Which is right? Pause and think.

22
00:01:56.544 --> 00:02:03.066
The describing word comes first: a blue car. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:03.216 --> 00:02:11.394
Try one more! What is the opposite of fast? Pause and think.

24
00:02:11.544 --> 00:02:16.890
The opposite of fast is slow. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:26.442
Try one more! A giraffe is tall. A mouse is, ___. Pause and think.

26
00:02:26.592 --> 00:02:31.866
The opposite of tall is short. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:32.016 --> 00:02:40.074
Try one more! What is the opposite of big? Pause and think.

28
00:02:40.224 --> 00:02:45.425
The opposite of big is small. Did you get it right?

29
00:02:45.576 --> 00:02:53.249
Last one! The sun is, ___. Pause and think.

30
00:02:53.399 --> 00:02:58.121
The sun is yellow. Did you get it right?

31
00:02:58.271 --> 00:03:04.817
Remember: describing words go before the noun or after is. Learn opposites in pairs.

32
00:03:04.967 --> 00:03:10.169
Describe your favourite toy with two describing words!

